  "scope": "Feat: TCE 事件上下文补全（行为零变化）。玩家侧 on_hit/on_crit 事件 context 增加 target/did_crit，为后续 damage 类 trigger（on-hit-with-crit、对 target 生效效果）提供数据。GenericSkill.on_hit/on_crit 重定向到 Stats 新增 trigger_on_hit_with_context/trigger_on_crit_with_context（带可选参数透传），事件仍单次派发；feat-tce 原函数保留（无调用方）。",
  "entities": [
    {
      "kind": "tce_context_enrichment",
      "id": "Scenes/Stats.gd::trigger_on_hit_with_context",
      "confidence": "FACT",
      "expected_runtime_effect": "玩家 on_hit TCE context 增加 target（防守方 Stats）与 did_crit（本次落地命中是否暴击）；仍单次派发；无 trigger 配置时行为与 vanilla 完全一致"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tce_context_enrichment",
      "id": "Scenes/Stats.gd::trigger_on_crit_with_context",
      "confidence": "FACT",
      "expected_runtime_effect": "玩家 on_crit TCE context 增加 target（防守方 Stats）；仍单次派发；无 trigger 配置时行为与 vanilla 完全一致"
    },
    {
      "kind": "tce_context_enrichment",
      "id": "Scenes/Skills/GenericSkill.gd::on_hit::forward",
      "confidence": "FACT",
      "expected_runtime_effect": "GenericSkill.on_hit(target, did_crit)/on_crit(target) 接受可选参数并重定向到带上下文派发；原守卫（not is_triggered and stats.is_player）与奖励分支不变"
    }
  ],
